                                      "json":  "## Quality and safety: turn spend into unit economics\nNo Foundry evaluation or Purview DLP data is flowing yet. Once you run Foundry evals or Purview DLP at the gateway, add a **cost per passing eval** tile and a **spend-at-risk** tile. Runnable join queries are in the [foundry-cost-roi-dashboard](https://github.com/rebmid/foundry-cost-roi-dashboard) README (Governance section)."
